            <div xml:id="d445">

                <pb facs="0623" n="543" sameAs="frus:frus1936v01/pg543"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.5151/950: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in France</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1936-09-08T20:00:00+01:00">September 8,
                            1936—8 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received September 8—1:55 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>843. From Cochran. Reference my 833, September 5, noon.<anchor n="17"
                        xml:id="d445-f1"/> French Minister of Finance handed to me French text of
                    document in question at 6 o’clock this evening. I am making English translation
                    which Rueff will check with me tonight. I may not therefore cable text until
                    Wednesday morning. Monick was at Ministry of Finance this evening. He will leave
                    for London tomorrow with text for British which cannot be delivered before late
                    Wednesday evening or Thursday morning. [Cochran.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
